    "updated_at": "2021-01-28T15:38:39Z",
    "body": "I just did a re-audit and, upon finishing it, realized the results are the same as your comment in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1336#issuecomment-557512704 .\r\n\r\nWe should be able to fix the discard and abort cases pretty easily. We could leave the plugin case alone for now. And then use #5096 and #5103 to track the remaining. But, I don't think we should close this until we fix the discard and abort cases.",
